Key Patterns

| Key Pattern                    | Type   | Value                                |
| ------------------------------ | ------ | ------------------------------------ |
| `session:{sessionID}`          | String | Session payload (JSON, msgpack, etc) |
| `session:{sessionID}:subject`  | String | SubjectID that owns this session     |
| `subject:{subjectID}:sessions` | Set    | SessionIDs for this subject          |
